# This is NOT a Gold unlock module.
# It contains NO HTTP request/response scripts, header rewrites, hostname MITM,
# DNS overrides, or QUIC blocking rules.
#
# IMPORTANT: Existing modules, manually installed CA certificates, VPN profiles,
# DNS profiles, and cached application state are NOT disabled by this file.
# Disable all other Locket-related modules and network profiles separately.
#
# If free filters still fail with Shadowrocket completely off and on cellular,
# the issue is outside this module. Check app/account/server status.
#
# No [Script] and no [MITM] entries intentionally.
